{"term": {"label": "親", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "3A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/teng-wen-gong-i", "title": "滕文公上", "description": "滕文公為世子，將之楚，過宋而見孟子。孟子道性善，言必稱堯舜。\n世子自楚反，復見孟子。孟子曰：「世子疑吾言乎？夫道一而已矣。成覸謂齊景公曰：『彼丈夫也，我丈夫也，吾何畏彼哉？』顏淵曰：『舜何人也？予何人也？有為者亦若是。』公明儀曰：『文王我師也，周公豈欺我哉？』今滕，絕長補短，將五十里也，猶可以為善國。《書》曰：『若藥不", "occurrences": 12, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "下", "id": "下"}, {"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "井", "id": "井"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "倍", "id": "倍"}, {"form": "先", "id": "先"}, {"form": "入", "id": "入"}, {"form": "反", "id": "反"}, {"form": "同", "id": "同"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "喪", "id": "喪"}, {"form": "地", "id": "地"}, {"form": "小", "id": "小"}, {"form": "師", "id": "師"}, {"form": "從", "id": "從"}, {"form": "掩", "id": "掩"}, {"form": "死", "id": "死"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "聞", "id": "聞"}, {"form": "至", "id": "至"}, {"form": "葬", "id": "葬"}, {"form": "親", "variants": [], "id": "親"}, {"form": "賢", "id": "賢"}, {"form": "赤子", "id": "赤子"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.8055527913603908, "source": "事", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 0.994622575144062, "source": "事", "target": "親"}, {"weight": 2.681021528714291, "source": "地", "target": "井"}, {"weight": 2.498699971920336, "source": "地", "target": "小"}, {"weight": 2.498699971920336, "source": "葬", "target": "死"}, {"weight": 2.211017899468555, "source": "葬", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 2.9041650800285006, "source": "葬", "target": "至"}, {"weight": 2.093234863812172, "source": "葬", "target": "親"}, {"weight": 2.7863820443721172, "source": "小", "target": "下"}, {"weight": 1.4870990602418561, "source": "小", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 1.6877697557040074, "source": "小", "target": "親"}, {"weight": 3.1918471524802814, "source": "小", "target": "同"}, {"weight": 2.681021528714291, "source": "同", "target": "井"}, {"weight": 1.8055527913603908, "source": "下", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 2.